window.RP_SESSION={"id":"S-64d187323207","messages":[{"id":"RP-III-0122428","time":"2026-07-20T13:43:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"세드릭 / 야바위꾼","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"…\n\n마을 시장의 구석가, 허름한 로브를 두른 노인이 야바위를 하고 있다.\n\n“자, 골라골라, 넣은 돈 두배~ 넣은 돈 두배~“","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-III-0122429","time":"2026-07-20T13:44:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"세드릭 / 야바위꾼","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"하, 허접한 속임수로군. 칼그람의 뒷골목이 키워낸 나에게 저 정도야.\n\n“여기, 낍니다.”\n\n실링 하나를 걸고 참여했다.","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-III-0122430","time":"2026-07-20T13:45:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"세드릭 / 야바위꾼","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"“호호, 그래그래. 딱 보니 산전수전 겪어본 얼굴이구만?”\n\n하, 허접하군. 말을 걸면서 주위를 분산시키려는 얄팍한 수다.","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-III-0122431","time":"2026-07-20T13:45:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"세드릭 / 야바위꾼","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"그래봤자…","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-III-0122432","time":"2026-07-20T13:45:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"세드릭 / 야바위꾼","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"!민첩","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-III-0122433","time":"2026-07-20T13:45:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"판정·진행 봇","profile":"《운명의 굴레》","identity":"bot","type":"bot","body":"매칭되는 캐릭터 정보를 찾을 수 없습니다.","characters":[]},{"id":"RP-III-0122434","time":"2026-07-20T13:46:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"세드릭 / 야바위꾼","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"!민첩","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-III-0122435","time":"2026-07-20T13:46:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"판정·진행 봇","profile":"《운명의 굴레》","identity":"bot","type":"bot","body":"'세드릭'의 민첩 판정 :\n[12] + [2] = [14]\n결과 : 완벽한 성공, 운명은 당신의 편입니다.","characters":[]},{"id":"RP-III-0122436","time":"2026-07-20T13:46:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"세드릭 / 야바위꾼","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"“왼쪽.”\n\n“엥? 어허… 거 마지막으로 바꿀 기회를…”\n\n“왼쪽.”","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-III-0122437","time":"2026-07-20T13:47:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"세드릭 / 야바위꾼","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"헤헤 아싸 2실링","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-III-0122438","time":"2026-07-20T13:47:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"세드릭 / 야바위꾼","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"”거 한 번 더 갑시다. 3실링.“","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-III-0122439","time":"2026-07-20T13:47:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"세드릭 / 야바위꾼","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"”그래그래, 한 번 먹고 빼면 사내가 아니지 응?”\n\n… 노인의 눈에 결의가 서린다!","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-III-0122440","time":"2026-07-20T13:48:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"세드릭 / 야바위꾼","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"후후, 하지만 이 몸은 세드릭. 별의 별 사기꾼을 본 나에게 이깟 손기술은…","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-III-0122441","time":"2026-07-20T13:48:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"세드릭 / 야바위꾼","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"!민첩","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-III-0122442","time":"2026-07-20T13:48:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"판정·진행 봇","profile":"《운명의 굴레》","identity":"bot","type":"bot","body":"'세드릭'의 민첩 판정 :\n[7] + [2] = [9]\n결과 : 훌륭한 성공, 운명이 당신을 이끕니다.","characters":[]},{"id":"RP-III-0122443","time":"2026-07-20T13:48:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"세드릭 / 야바위꾼","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"안 통한다!\n“가운데.”","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-III-0122444","time":"2026-07-20T13:49:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"세드릭 / 야바위꾼","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"찰나 노인의 표정이 찌그러지는 걸 봤다.\n“자, 확인 들어갑니다? 따라란, 따라라. 쿵짝짝, 쿵짝짝~”","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-III-0122445","time":"2026-07-20T13:50:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"세드릭 / 야바위꾼","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"“뭐야 왜 없어. 아니 내 이 두눈으로 똑똑히 봤는데. 소매 까봐, 소매까봐!“","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-III-0122446","time":"2026-07-20T13:51:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"세드릭 / 야바위꾼","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"… 노인이 주변을 둘러보자 내 두배는 되어보이는 무게의 사내들이 몽둥이를 들고 다가온다.\n\n”… 에헤이… 잘못 봤나 보네요? 허허.”","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-III-0122447","time":"2026-07-20T13:52:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"세드릭 / 야바위꾼","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"뭐… 그렇게 1실링 손해보고 쫓겨났다. 쩝.\n\n오늘 일은… 나만의 비밀로 둬야겠다.\n\n길드에서 식량이나 축내야지. 엣헴.","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-III-0122448","time":"2026-07-20T13:52:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"세드릭 / 야바위꾼","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"-fin","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-III-0122449","time":"2026-07-20T13:52:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"판정·진행 봇","profile":"《운명의 굴레》","identity":"bot","type":"bot","body":"\"아주 멋진 한판이었어!\"","characters":[]}]};
